  "closure_status": "council-mcp LOCAL CERTIFICATION (Phase 1A-2C). A standalone, clean-room Alexa+ MCP Deliberation Council: OAuth 2.1 resource+authorization server with PKCE S256, MCP Streamable-HTTP transport, SQLite (WAL) persistence with migrations, bounded background worker with retry/recovery, the Concept A council (four independent perspectives, synthesis with preserved dissent, a QUEUED->RUNNING->SYNTHESIZING->COMPLETED state machine with FAILED and cooperative CANCELLED), a deterministic offline default provider and an optional local Ollama provider with safe fallback, strict account isolation at the store layer, and an append-only audit trail. Certified locally only: no GitHub repository, no push, no Amazon/Alexa resources, no public deploy, no OAuth registration with Alexa, no competition entry. This seal is self-contained and chains no external seal.",
